CrossChain Archive — Project Complete! 🎉                                                                                           
                                                                                                                                      
  We just wrapped all 5 milestones on the CrossChain Archive — a unified indexer and archival system for cross-chain bridge         
  transactions. Here's what we built:                                                                                                 
  
  What it does                                                                                                                        
  Indexes cross-chain messages across Ethereum, Arbitrum, Optimism, Base, Polygon, Avalanche, and BSC — correlates source and       
  destination transactions end-to-end — and archives everything immutably to Akave O3.                                                
  
  Supported Protocols                                                                                                                 
  LayerZero V2, Wormhole, Axelar, and Chainlink CCIP — each with full source/destination event correlation.                         
                                                                                                                                      
  Core Infrastructure
  - Multi-chain RPC ingestion with confirmation depth enforcement                                                                     
  - Protocol decoder registry — plug in a new protocol with one interface                                                             
  - Normalization + correlation engine — matches source TX to destination TX across chains
  - PostgreSQL hot storage + Akave O3 cold archival (Snappy-compressed Parquet, SHA-256 verified)                                     
                                                                                                                                      
  REST API                                                                                                                            
  Full query layer — messages by ID, by address, by transaction, cross-chain traces, protocol stats, route analytics, and historical  
  read-back from O3 archives                                                                                                          
                                                                                                                                    
  Production Hardening                                                                                                                
  - Reorg detection with automatic cursor rewind                                                                                    
  - RPC failover across multiple endpoints with exponential backoff                                                                   
  - Backfill CLI for historical range indexing                     
  - Structured logging (zerolog) + 7 Prometheus metrics                                                                               
  - CI pipeline: lint → unit tests → integration tests → Docker build                                                               
                                                                                                                                      
  Documentation
  Architecture overview, setup guide, API reference, protocol addition guide, and data schema reference — enough for a new developer  
  to get running and extend the system independently.                                                                                 
  
